{"step_index":1529,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-25T14:46:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-25T20:16:05+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-25T20:16:19+05:30\n\nThe command exited with code 1.\nOutput:\n=================================================\nPHASE 5: COMPREHENSIVE SYSTEM & REGRESSION AUDIT\n=================================================\n\n[1] Verifying Static Files & UI Structure:\n  ✓ [PASS] index.html exists\n  ✓ [PASS] styles.css exists\n  ✓ [PASS] app.js exists\n  ✓ [PASS] explainer.js exists\n  ✓ [PASS] engine.js exists\n  ✓ [PASS] Step progress label present\n  ✓ [PASS] Previous button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Next button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Auto Play button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Restart button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Animations toggle button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Speed button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Prediction quiz toggle button present\n  ✓ [PASS] Test input chips container present\n  ✓ [PASS] Teaching code box 